  "duration": 200,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "原来订单和库存记在不同的数据库里，各记各的，一个成了，另一个没成。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 6.396,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "signal-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.233,
  "audioFrames": 157,
  "duration": 175,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 200,
  "chapter": "signal",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "把这些库想成驿站：红站记订单，蓝站管货架。",
    "start": 0.009,
    "dur": 5.212,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.667,
  "audioFrames": 290,
  "duration": 298,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "同一个库里，一笔事务能全部撤回；可数据分到不同的库以后，每个站只能撤回自己账本上的字，管不到对方的货架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.666,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "local-2": {
  "audioSec": 3.0,
  "audioFrames": 90,
  "duration": 108,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 298,
  "chapter": "local",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "常见的办法有四种，我们一种一种讲。",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 2.99,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
