  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第一种，两阶段提交。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.11,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "以 MySQL 八点四为例，每个库都听一个拿对讲机的调度员指挥。",
    "start": 2.39,
    "dur": 5.332,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pc-prepare-1": {
  "audioSec": 2.767,
  "audioFrames": 83,
  "duration": 91,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "pc-prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "调度员先挨个问：准备好了吗？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.767,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pc-prepare-2": {
  "audioSec": 5.967,
  "audioFrames": 179,
  "duration": 197,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 91,
  "chapter": "pc-prepare",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站用铅笔写好订单，先不盖章；蓝站把货挪进待出库的格子锁住。",
    "start": 0.014,
    "dur": 5.968,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pc-commit-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.2,
  "audioFrames": 246,
  "duration": 264,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "pc-commit",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "只有红站蓝站都举绿牌，调度员才喊一起盖章；只要有一个站举红牌，就喊全部擦掉。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.184,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pc-cost-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.533,
  "audioFrames": 346,
  "duration": 364,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "pc-cost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "它的代价是：对讲机要是突然没声了，红站拿着铅笔单，蓝站锁着货，既不敢盖章也不敢擦，只能干等。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.577,
    "src": "ch7-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "货一直锁着，别人也买不走。",
    "start": 8.857,
    "dur": 2.687,
    "src": "ch7-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "pc-wrap-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.3,
  "audioFrames": 129,
  "duration": 147,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "pc-wrap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这就是两阶段提交：先准备、再统一生效。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.292,
    "src": "ch8-1"
   }
  ]
 },
