  "chapter": "saga-do",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "每个站做完自己这一步，就直接盖章，再通知下一个站。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.955,
    "src": "ch15-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "蓝站先真把货出了库，接着轮到红站记订单。",
    "start": 4.235,
    "dur": 4.416,
    "src": "ch15-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-compensate-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.2,
  "audioFrames": 156,
  "duration": 164,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "saga-compensate",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "要是红站这一步失败了，蓝站就做一个反向的动作，把货重新上架。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.19,
    "src": "ch16-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-compensate-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.833,
  "audioFrames": 145,
  "duration": 163,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 164,
  "chapter": "saga-compensate",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这不是时光倒流，货确实出过库，只是又补了回来。",
    "start": 0.003,
    "dur": 4.843,
    "src": "ch16-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-cost-1": {
  "audioSec": 5.733,
  "audioFrames": 172,
  "duration": 181,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "saga-cost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "代价是：中间那段时间，别人能看见货架空了，Saga 不保证隔离。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.747,
    "src": "ch17-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "saga-cost-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.167,
  "audioFrames": 125,
  "duration": 143,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 181,
  "chapter": "saga-cost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
