  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第四种，可靠消息。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.026,
    "src": "ch19-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "这回只有红站自己记账，再保证把条子送到。",
    "start": 2.306,
    "dur": 4.477,
    "src": "ch19-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-half-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.9,
  "audioFrames": 147,
  "duration": 156,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "msg-half",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "红站先把一张通知仓库的条子交给邮局，邮局先收着，不送。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.914,
    "src": "ch20-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-half-2": {
  "audioSec": 7.3,
  "audioFrames": 219,
  "duration": 237,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 156,
  "chapter": "msg-half",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "等订单记好了，红站再告诉邮局：可以送了；订单没记成，就让邮局把条子作废。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.312,
    "src": "ch20-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-check-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.0,
  "audioFrames": 180,
  "duration": 197,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "msg-check",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "要是邮局一直没等到回话，就回头问红站：订单记上了吗？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.519,
    "src": "ch21-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "记上了才送。",
    "start": 4.799,
    "dur": 1.188,
    "src": "ch21-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-deliver-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.133,
  "audioFrames": 214,
  "duration": 222,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "msg-deliver",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "条子送到蓝站，蓝站没处理好，就再送一次；蓝站认单号，重复送来的不再扣。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 7.118,
    "src": "ch22-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-deliver-2": {
  "audioSec": 3.7,
  "audioFrames": 111,
  "duration": 129,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 222,
  "chapter": "msg-deliver",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这里不会自动撤回订单，只把条子送到为止。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.684,
    "src": "ch22-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-cost-1": {
  "audioSec": 4.5,
  "audioFrames": 135,
  "duration": 153,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "msg-cost",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "代价是：蓝站没处理好，只能重送，不会自动撤回订单。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 4.513,
    "src": "ch23-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "msg-wrap-1": {
  "audioSec": 3.4,
  "audioFrames": 102,
  "duration": 131,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "msg-wrap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "这就是可靠消息：先记下来，再保证送到。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.404,
    "src": "ch24-1"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 120,
  "holdAt": 120,
  "extraHold": 11,
  "labelHold": 11
 },
 "eventual-1": {
  "audioSec": 10.6,
  "audioFrames": 318,
  "duration": 337,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "eventual",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "Saga 和可靠消息，这两种都是最终一致：中间会有一段时间，订单和库存对不上，等补偿或重送做成了，最后再对上。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 10.606,
    "src": "ch25-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 31.433,
  "audioFrames": 943,
  "duration": 951,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "四种办法放在一起看：两阶段提交，先准备、再统一生效，货一直锁着，别人也买不走；TCC，先预留，再确认或取消，每个业务都得自己写预留、确认、取消这三套动作；Saga，先做，失败了再补偿，中间那段时间，别人能看见货架空了；可靠消息，先记下来，再保证送到，通知一定发出去；临时失败靠重试，永久失败要另外设计补偿或人工处理。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 31.43,
    "src": "ch26-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "audioSec": 3.1,
  "audioFrames": 93,
  "duration": 185,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 951,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
